message: "If you use this mathematical work, interval-arithmetic suite, or continuum certification architecture, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Parity-Reduced Transverse Wronskians, Higher Dipole Invariants, and Rigorous Continuum Certification for Riemann's Xi-Function"
authors:
  - family-names: "Missiaen"
    given-names: "Thijs"
